@startuml
title kubescape/host-scanner - System Architecture (SRS-derived)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "HTTP Client / E2E Tests" as Client

cloud "Kubernetes Cluster" as K8s {
  node "Kubernetes Node" as Node {
    frame "Host OS" as HostOS {
      folder "/etc" as etc
      folder "/run" as run
      folder "/var/lib" as varlib
      folder "/etc/cni" as etc_cni
      folder "/var/lib/cni" as varlib_cni
    }

    node "DaemonSet Pod: host-scanner" as Pod {
      component "host-scanner HTTP Service" as API
      component "Request Router" as Router
      component "CNI Directory Resolver" as CNIResolver
      component "JSON Sanitizer\n(encryption provider secret removal)" as Sanitizer
    }

    component "Kubelet" as Kubelet
    component "Container Runtime\n(containerd / CRI-O)" as Runtime
  }
}

Client -down-> API : HTTP GET/Response\n(404 for unknown paths e.g. /doesnotexist)
API --> Router
Router --> Sanitizer : sanitize control-plane JSON
Router --> CNIResolver : resolve CNI config dir

CNIResolver ..> Runtime : runtime type
CNIResolver ..> Kubelet : kubelet config hints
CNIResolver ..> etc : read configuration files
CNIResolver ..> run : runtime state
CNIResolver ..> varlib : runtime data
CNIResolver ..> etc_cni : default CNI dir\n(kubelet/containerd defaults)
CNIResolver ..> varlib_cni : explicit CLI arg\n/ runtime-specific location

file "Control-plane JSON Input" as json_in
file "Sanitized JSON Output" as json_out
json_in --> Sanitizer
Sanitizer --> json_out

note right of API
- Exposes HTTP endpoints
- Returns 404 for unknown e.g. /doesnotexist
- Standard HTTP semantics
end note

note right of CNIResolver
Resolves CNI configuration directory from:
- runtime type
- defaults
- configuration-file content
- CLI --cni-dir argument
Expected results by scenario:
- /etc/cni/ (kubelet/containerd defaults)
- /var/lib/cni/ (explicit arg)
- config-derived subpaths
end note

note right of Sanitizer
Removes encryption provider configuration secrets
from control-plane JSON before output.
end note

component "Provider-specific E2E Tests" as E2E
E2E .. Client : Go build tags\n//go:build <provider>\nselect expectations

@enduml